  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **So Romantic** (2 reviews): Reviewer calls this the nastiest, most bad-ass version of the song they have heard; Reviewer names Romantic among the standout songs [2][4]\n- **Lenny** (1 review): Reviewer singles out Lenny as a highlight of the show [4]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **So Romantic**: back after 76 archived shows (542 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **Tues. Night Squad**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Nay**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2001-10-20** (recommended): source not stated; 9 songs; 115 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer counts this among the best recordings on archive.org [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Sylvia Gordon guested on vocals and Andre played alto sax, per the notes' guest markings [1]\n- Reviewer saw the band the night before, 10-19-01, was blown away by the live power, and regrets missing this night [3]\n- Reviewer ranks the performance among the best of the Sam era [2]\n- Reviewer considers the show a good representation of the band's year in 2001 [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2001-10-20**: taped by Dan Reese; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: DSBD > D8 (44.1) [1]",
